# The Maven artifacts the Android embedding's Java tests run with (D12):
# shell/platform/android/test_runner/build.gradle's test dependencies and the
# embedding's own (tools/androidx/files.json), resolved by Gradle --
#
#   gradle -Pflutter_jar=... dependencies --configuration debugUnitTestRuntimeClasspath
#
# in test_runner/, each coordinate at the version Gradle's conflict resolution
# chose -- plus Robolectric's android-all jar for the SDK robolectric.properties
# names (sdk=37), which Robolectric would otherwise download at first use.
# maven_lock.py turns this list into maven.lock.bzl (the files, pinned by
# sha256); edit this file, rerun it. Lines starting with # are comments.
#
# The android-all jars are every SDK from the embedding's minimum (24) to the
# one robolectric.properties names (37), at the builds Robolectric 4.17's
# DefaultSdkProvider expects: a test with @Config(minSdk, maxSdk) runs once per
# SDK in its range, as under Gradle.
